# The WHOLE data/ tree, not just the two image dirs it used to name. The runtime
# creates /app/data itself (see the Dockerfile mkdir) and COPYs nothing from here,
# so every byte under data/ was context uploaded to the daemon for nothing. On a
# machine with the 360 acervo loaded that is data/sv360, measured at 65 GB, which
# turned `docker build` into a multi-minute copy before the first instruction ran.
